sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as "Manager/HR"
    participant View as "Web View (approvals.business-trips.index)"
    participant Controller as "BusinessTripApprovalController"
    participant Model as "BusinessTrip Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Admin->>View: Buka halaman Approval Perjalanan Dinas
    View->>Controller: GET /approvals/business-trips
    Controller->>Model: Build filter (status, worker, month, year, department)
    Model->>DB: SELECT business_trips + relasi worker/department
    DB-->>Model: Data pengajuan + pagination
    Model-->>Controller: Koleksi pengajuan

    alt Data valid (query berhasil)
        Controller->>View: Render tabel, statistik, filter
        View-->>Admin: Daftar pengajuan perjalanan dinas tampil
    else Data tidak valid (query gagal)
        Controller->>View: Redirect back + error
        View-->>Admin: Notifikasi gagal memuat data
    end
